-> T26 Phase 3b: inside `if s ∈ Object { ... }`, s is genuinely narrowed to
-> just the Object-shaped alternative(s) — a value from the excluded
-> (String) alternative must still contradict, proving this is real
-> narrowing and not just a label on the branch.
Status = { "Success" } ∪ { tag = "Error", code ∈ Number }
s ∈ Status
if s ∈ Object {
    s = "Success"
}
